{
  "id": "NUM.33",
  "number": "33",
  "bookId": "NUM",
  "reference": "Numbers 33",
  "verseCount": 56,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "33",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "33",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the stages of the people of Israel, when they went forth out of the land of Egypt by their hosts under the leadership of Moses and Aaron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses wrote down their starting places, stage by stage, by command of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; and these are their stages according to their starting places. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They set out from Rameses in the first month, on the fifteenth day of the first month; on the day after the passover the people of Israel went out triumphantly in the sight of all the Egyptians, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "while the Egyptians were burying all their first-born, whom the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had struck down among them; upon their gods also the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " executed judgments.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the people of Israel set out from Rameses, and encamped at Succoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Succoth, and encamped at Etham, which is on the edge of the wilderness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Etham, and turned back to Pi-hahiroth, which is east of Baal-zephon; and they encamped before Migdol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from before Hahiroth, and passed through the midst of the sea into the wilderness, and they went a three days' journey in the wilderness of Etham, and encamped at Marah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Marah, and came to Elim; at Elim there were twelve springs of water and seventy palm trees, and they encamped there. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Elim, and encamped by the Red Sea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from the Red Sea, and encamped in the wilderness of Sin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from the wilderness of Sin, and encamped at Dophkah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Dophkah, and encamped at Alush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Alush, and encamped at Rephidim, where there was no water for the people to drink. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Rephidim, and encamped in the wilderness of Sinai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from the wilderness of Sinai, and encamped at Kibroth-hattaavah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Kibroth-hattaavah, and encamped at Hazeroth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Hazeroth, and encamped at Rithmah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Rithmah, and encamped at Rimmon-perez. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Rimmon-perez, and encamped at Libnah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Libnah, and encamped at Rissah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Rissah, and encamped at Kehelathah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Kehelathah, and encamped at Mount Shepher. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Mount Shepher, and encamped at Haradah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Haradah, and encamped at Makheloth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Makheloth, and encamped at Tahath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Tahath, and encamped at Terah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Terah, and encamped at Mithkah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Mithkah, and encamped at Hashmonah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Hashmonah, and encamped at Moseroth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Moseroth, and encamped at Bene-jaakan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Bene-jaakan, and encamped at Hor-haggidgad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Hor-haggidgad, and encamped at Jotbathah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Jotbathah, and encamped at Abronah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Abronah, and encamped at Ezion-geber. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Ezion-geber, and encamped in the wilderness of Zin (that is, Kadesh). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they set out from Kadesh, and encamped at Mount Hor, on the edge of the land of Edom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
